<p class="small">The Prospecting Show · Editorial sales resource · Published October 12, 2026 · Updated November 22, 2026</p>
<p>An ideal customer profile for analytics services should explain which reporting problem your team can solve, what evidence the account can provide, and who will use the result. Measuring the profile means checking those conditions against a defined group of accounts. A long list of companies and a filled-in CRM are insufficient evidence of fit.</p>
<p>This exercise concerns B2B sales account selection. It does not assess individuals, creditworthiness, financial-account activity, or eligibility for a service. The offer, accounts, and numbers below are fictional practice inputs, not client results, market benchmarks, or a forecast.</p>
