<ol><li>Keep a fixed list of reviewed accounts for the period; do not delete unsuitable rows to improve the fit rate.</li><li>Use the same offer version and evidence-field definitions across that review.</li><li>Reconcile all dispositions to the number of reviewed accounts.</li><li>Count known fields independently of whether their answers support the sale.</li><li>When evidence changes, preserve the previous review and record the new date and reason.</li></ol>
