<h2>Choose the next action from the missing evidence</h2>
<p>For Practice Analytics B, the next useful action is to ask who can approve the inputs and clarify workshop scope. Sending another generic capabilities deck would not resolve either gate. For C, accepting the buyer's no-problem answer prevents an unsupported opportunity from entering the forecast. For D, a modest relevance question is more appropriate than a claim that the company urgently needs analytics help.</p>
